## 10. Error Response Format

All errors return:

```json
{
  "error": "SLOT_TAKEN",
  "message": "This time slot has already been booked."
}
```

Standard error codes: `UNAUTHORIZED`, `FORBIDDEN`, `NOT_FOUND`, `VALIDATION_ERROR`, `SLOT_TAKEN`, `ONBOARDING_REQUIRED`, `ALREADY_REVIEWED`.

---

## 11. Rate Limiting

| Route                      | Limit                 |
| -------------------------- | --------------------- |
| All `/api/*`               | 100 req / 15 min / IP |
| `POST /api/sessions`       | 10 req / hour / user  |
| `POST /api/reviews`        | 5 req / hour / user   |
| `POST /api/auth/sign-in/*` | 10 req / 15 min / IP  |

---

## 12. Scope Boundary (v1)

**In scope:** Auth, profiles, mentor browse, availability, session booking, Daily.co video, reviews, notifications, admin verification.

**Out of scope for v1:** In-app messaging/chat, payments (eSewa/Khalti), push notifications, mobile app, mentor analytics dashboard, group sessions, resource sharing.
